```gitignore
node_modules/
build/
dist/
coverage/
.DS_Store
*.log
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.android.example

# Throwaway Chrome profiles from the browser QA harness (must live outside
# the project — a locked profile inside frontend/ crashes Vite's file watcher)
.chrome-*/

# IDE settings
.idea/
**/.idea/
```     